Tests practical memory locality, lock-free design, and efficient reclamation in NUMA contexts.

## Key Concepts
- NUMA-aware allocator design
- Lock-free per-thread caches
- Batch refill to minimize cross-socket traffic
- ABA avoidance with per-slot counters
- Cache-line padding to prevent false sharing

